<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>全收益指数回撤分析工具 (专业深色版)</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/echarts@5.4.3/dist/echarts.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji";
            background-color: #0d1117; 
            color: #e6edf3; 
            padding: 24px; 
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
        
        .header { margin-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; padding-bottom: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
        .header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; color: #f0f6fc; }
        .header .subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 4px; }

        .top-controls { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; }
        .selector { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
        
        .btn { 
            padding: 5px 12px; border: 1px solid #30363d; background: #21262d; color: #c9d1d9;
            cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; transition: 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.3, 0, 0.5, 1); 
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: #30363d; border-color: #8b949e; }
        .btn.active { background: #1f6feb; color: #ffffff; border-color: #388bfd; }
        
        .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .stat-card { 
            background: #161b22; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #30363d; 
            box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(1,4,9,0.04);
        }
        .stat-card h3 { font-size: 12px; color: #8b949e; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 600; }
        .stat-card p { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #f0f6fc; }
        .stat-card .sub-text { font-size: 11px; color: #484f58; margin-top: 6px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, SF Mono, Menlo, Consolas, Liberation Mono, monospace; }
        
        .val-blue { color: #58a6ff !important; }
        .val-red { color: #f85149 !important; }
        
        .chart-box { background: #161b22; border: 1px solid #30363d; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .chart-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
        .chart-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #f0f6fc; }
        
        #chart-main, #chart-dd { width: 100%; height: 480px; }
        
        .update-panel { margin-top: 32px; padding: 24px; background-color: #161b22; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #30363d; }
        .update-panel h2 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #f0f6fc; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
        
        .input-group { display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .input-item { flex: 1; min-width: 200px; }
        label { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: #8b949e; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 500; }
        input { 
            width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #0d1117; border: 1px solid #30363d; 
            border-radius: 6px; color: #e6edf3; outline: none; font-size: 14px;
        }
        input:focus { border-color: #1f6feb; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(31,111,235,0.2); }
        
        .action-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
        .btn-update { background: #238636; color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(240,246,252,0.1); padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
        .btn-update:hover { background: #2ea043; }
        .btn-download { background: #21262d; color: #c9d1d9; border: 1px solid #30363d; padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
        .btn-download:hover { background: #30363d; border-color: #8b949e; }
        .btn-reset { background: transparent; color: #f85149; border: 1px solid rgba(248,81,73,0.2); padding: 8px 16px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; }
        .btn-reset:hover { background: rgba(248,81,73,0.1); border-color: #f85149; }
        
        .footer { margin-top: 48px; text-align: center; color: #484f58; font-size: 11px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #21262d; padding-top: 16px; }
        .save-tip { font-size: 12px; color: #3fb950; margin-top: 12px; display: none; font-weight: 500; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div>
                <h1>全收益指数回撤分析工具</h1>
                <div class="subtitle">实时跟踪历史高点回撤及滚动分位风险参考</div>
            </div>
            <div class="action-btns">
                <button class="btn-download" onclick="downloadNewVersion()">💾 导出新版本</button>
                <button class="btn-reset" onclick="resetToOriginal()">🔄 重置</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="top-controls">
            <div class="selector" id="index-selector"></div>
            <div class="selector">
                <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #8b949e; margin-right: 4px;">净值图区间:</span>
                <button class="btn" onclick="setMainZoomByMonths(3)">近3月</button>
                <button class="btn" onclick="setMainZoomByMonths(6)">近6月</button>
                <button class="btn" onclick="setMainZoomByMonths(12)">近1年</button>
                <button class="btn" onclick="setMainZoomByMonths(36)">3年</button>
                <button class="btn" onclick="setMainZoomByMonths(60)">5年</button>
                <button class="btn active" id="main-zoom-all" onclick="setMainZoomByMonths(0)">全部</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stats-grid">
            <div class="stat-card"><h3>最新指数点位</h3><p id="stat-val" class="val-blue">-</p><div class="sub-text">Index Point Value</div></div>
            <div class="stat-card"><h3>当前回撤位置</h3><p id="stat-curr-dd" class="val-red">-</p><div class="sub-text">Current Drawdown</div></div>
            <div class="stat-card"><h3>历史最大回撤</h3><p id="stat-max-dd">-</p><div class="sub-text">Historical Max DD</div></div>
            <div class="stat-card"><h3>最后更新日期</h3><p id="stat-date" style="font-size: 20px;">-</p><div class="sub-text">Updated On</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-box">
            <div class="chart-title" id="main-chart-title" style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:15px;">累计净值走势</div>
            <div id="chart-main"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="chart-box">
            <div class="chart-header">
                <div class="chart-title" id="dd-chart-title">历史回撤与风险分位线</div>
                <div class="selector">
                    <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #8b949e; margin-right: 4px;">回撤图区间:</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="setDDZoomByMonths(3)">近3月</button>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="setDDZoomByMonths(6)">近6月</button>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="setDDZoomByMonths(12)">近1年</button>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="setDDZoomByMonths(36)">3年</button>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="setDDZoomByMonths(60)">5年</button>
                    <button class="btn active" id="dd-zoom-all" onclick="setDDZoomByMonths(0)">全部</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div id="chart-dd"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="update-panel">
            <h2>⚙️ 每日数据更新面板</h2>
            <div class="input-group">
                <div class="input-item"><label>选择日期</label><input type="date" id="new-date"></div>
                <div class="input-item"><label>输入全收益点位</label><input type="number" step="0.01" id="new-value" placeholder="例如: 12345.67"></div>
                <button class="btn-update" onclick="manualUpdate()">更新并保存数据</button>
            </div>
            <p id="save-status" class="save-tip">✅ 数据已成功持久化至浏览器存储</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">Professional Financial Analysis Tool | Built by Manus AI</div>
    </div>

